[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p>1. With the window fully raised, remove the door rod trim.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the window guide.</p><p>3. Remove the window guide.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019030.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the guide is undamaged.</p><p>Fit the guide.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p>Fit the door rod trim.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p>Check that the window works properly.</p>"]]